        "data": {
          "comment": "# Turn Specs into Product Copy\n\nTurns a spec sheet into a product description. The system prompt forbids facts that are not in the input, so the copy stays safe to publish.\n\n**How it works:** Paste the specification list into \"1 Input\". \"2 Agent\" writes the description from those facts only and leaves out anything missing. \"3 Output\" returns the copy.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"2 Agent\" and remove one spec from the input to confirm it does not reappear in the copy."
